### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### List articles (replace TOKEN with a fresh Clerk session token)
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/articles
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Create an article
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/article
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A sample title",
  "category": "programming",
  "content": "Write article content here."
}

### Add a comment
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/comment/ARTICLE_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment": "A sample comment."
}
